{"overview":"سال ۱۹۹۳ است و دوران شهرت تد خرسه گذشته و او با بهترین دوستش، جان بنت ۱۶ ساله، که در خانه‌ای کارگری در بوستون به همراه والدین و پسرعمویش زندگی می‌کند، زندگی می‌کند. تد شاید بهترین تأثیر را روی جان نداشته باشد، اما وقتی نوبت به واقعیت می‌رسد، او حاضر است برای کمک به دوست و خانواده‌اش، هر کاری از دستش بربیاید.","tagline":"","overview_en":"It's 1993 and Ted the bear's moment of fame has passed, leaving him living with his best friend, 16-year-old John Bennett, who lives in a working-class Boston home with his parents and cousin. Ted may not be the best influence on John, but when it comes right down to it, he's willing to go out on a limb to help his friend and his family.","tagline_en":"You can't spell 'family' without FML.","runtime":null,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":7,"y":2024,"poster":"/cPn71YFDENH0JkWUezlsLyWmLfN.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":8,"y":2026,"poster":"/cj0X332IzkmWv5I2o1mdkWJTmQN.jpg"}],"episodes":15,"crew":["ست مک‌فارلن"],"crew_en":["Seth MacFarlane"],"countries":["US"],"cast":[{"name":"ست مک‌فارلن","role":"Ted (voice)","photo":"/8oQJqM51Z0Qtdb7sE6ZfX1peNCB.jpg","en":"Seth MacFarlane"},{"name":"مکس برکهولدر","role":"John Bennett","photo":"/8uNNDZPSxLsNetHPl1zxMwKULTC.jpg","en":"Max Burkholder"},{"name":"آلانا اوباک","role":"Susan Bennett","photo":"/ffyBAEoW3bDgVJQV3GaHsZ9x29W.jpg","en":"Alanna Ubach"},{"name":"Scott Grimes","role":"Matty Bennett","photo":"/k5OCDhwZoFuNtN0o4EDkpBXQsFp.jpg"},{"name":"جورجیا ویگام","role":"Blaire Bennett","photo":"/yiCRUdLNsLkuNv9q2w47rzB0FBn.jpg","en":"Giorgia Whigham"}],"trailer":"aq2Vt7OvQG0","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/201834-ted/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"Peacock Premium","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/a1UIdq5BrkcAxnxcUhFsNbXnxeu.png"},{"n":"Peacock Premium Plus","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/yrEwyMzEKdqAoGhaWUARtIxByol.png"},{"n":"Amazon Video","kind":"buy","logo":"/jn6TLbtaTZntTRX9UYucHJvpQx1.png"},{"n":"Apple TV Store","kind":"buy","logo":"/qdEGArH3lKfF